  m_Name: ArcadeGameHarvest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 88
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Harvest
  Description: 'Threshers only - a field of sheaves floating in every direction, each a core of blocks
    bristling with stalks. Press A to leave Mass Mode and break. Mow the stalks with your
    chain to charge the ball, then whip it into the core and the charge goes off as one
    blast. Only prisms that are not your colour count. Crystals in the clear centre windmill
    your red-hot ball round you. Higher intensities shield the cores, colour the sheaves by
    team and add danger stalks. First team to the harvest target wins.'
